msgstr "Zavrieť"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:339
msgid "Label (admin reference)"
msgstr "Označenie (administratívna referencia)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:341
msgid "e.g. Offer Course B when Course A or C in cart"
msgstr "napr. Ponúknuť kurz B, keď je v košíku kurz A alebo C"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:342
msgid "Internal name for this rule."
msgstr "Interný názov tohto pravidla."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:346
msgid "Trigger Product IDs (comma-separated, OR condition)"
msgstr "ID spúšťacích produktov (oddelené čiarkou, podmienka ALEBO)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:349
#, php-format
msgid ""
"One or more product IDs. Offer shows if ANY of these are in cart. <a "
"href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Find product IDs</a>."
msgstr ""
"Jedno alebo viac ID produktov. Ponuka sa zobrazí, ak je v košíku ktorýkoľvek "
"z nich. <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Zistiť ID produktov</a>."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:353
msgid "Offer Product ID"
msgstr "ID ponúkaného produktu"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:356
msgid "Product to offer when any trigger is in cart."
msgstr "Produkt, ktorý sa ponúkne, keď je v košíku akýkoľvek spúšťací produkt."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:360
msgid "Custom Content (optional)"
msgstr "Vlastný obsah (voliteľné)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:363
msgid ""
"Optional: Custom HTML/shortcode for the offer. If empty, a default \"Add to "
"Cart\" button for the offer product will be shown. Available shortcodes: "
"[ajax_add_to_cart], [button], etc."
msgstr ""
"Voliteľné: vlastný HTML/skratkový kód ponuky. Ak je prázdne, zobrazí sa "
"predvolené tlačidlo „Pridať do košíka“ pre ponúkaný produkt. Dostupné "
"skratky: [ajax_add_to_cart], [button] atď."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:367
msgid "Display Where"
msgstr "Miesto zobrazenia"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:369
msgid "Popup (modal)"
msgstr "Popup (modálne okno)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:370
msgid "Toast notification (auto-dismiss)"
msgstr "Upozornenie (automatické zatvorenie)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:371
msgid ""
"Choose how the offer is presented automatically when the trigger product is "
"added to the cart. The <code>[m4w_wco_offer]</code> shortcode can be placed "
"anywhere and works independently of these options."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte, ako sa ponuka automaticky zobrazí po pridaní spúšťacieho produktu "
"do košíka. Skratkový kód <code>[m4w_wco_offer]</code> môžete umiestniť "
"kdekoľvek a funguje nezávisle od týchto možností."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:375
msgid "Toast Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Čas zobrazenia upozornenia (sekundy)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:378
msgid ""
"How long the toast stays visible before auto-dismissing. Only applies to "
"toast mode."
msgstr ""
"Ako dlho zostane upozornenie viditeľné, kým sa automaticky zatvorí. Platí "
"len pre režim upozornenia."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:382
msgid "Toast Custom CSS"
msgstr "Vlastné CSS upozornenia"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:385
msgid ""
"Optional CSS applied only to this rule's toast. Write selectors for the "
"inner content (e.g. <code>.conditional-offer-title</code>, <code>img</code>, "
"<code>button</code>). To style the toast container itself use <code>.m4w-wco-"
"toast</code>."
msgstr ""
"Voliteľné CSS použité len pre toto upozornenie pravidla. Napíšte selektory "
"pre vnútorný obsah (napr. <code>.conditional-offer-title</code>, <code>img</"
"code>, <code>button</code>). Na úpravu samotného kontajnera upozornenia "
"použite <code>.m4w-wco-toast</code>."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:389
msgid "Popup/Toast Delay (seconds)"
msgstr "Oneskorenie popup/upozornenia (sekundy)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:392
msgid ""
"Delay before showing toast/popup after trigger product is added to cart. Set "
"to 0 for immediate."
msgstr ""
"Oneskorenie pred zobrazením upozornenia/popupu po pridaní spúšťacieho "
"produktu do košíka. Pre okamžité zobrazenie nastavte 0."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:396
msgid "Popup Once Per Session"
msgstr "Popup raz za reláciu"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:400
msgid "Only show popup once per browser session (uses session cookie)"
msgstr "Zobraziť popup len raz za reláciu prehliadača (používa cookie relácie)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:406
msgid "Automatic Discount (when both products in cart)"
msgstr "Automatická zľava (keď sú oba produkty v košíku)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:409
msgid "Enable Automatic Discount"
msgstr "Povoliť automatickú zľavu"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:413
msgid ""
"Apply discount automatically when both trigger and offer products are in cart"
msgstr ""
"Automaticky uplatniť zľavu, keď sú v košíku spúšťací aj ponúkaný produkt"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:418
msgid "Discount Type"
msgstr "Typ zľavy"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:421
msgid "Percentage (%)"
msgstr "Percentuálna (%)"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:422
msgid "Fixed amount"
msgstr "Pevná suma"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:424
msgid "Type of discount to apply."
msgstr "Typ zľavy, ktorý sa má uplatniť."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:428
msgid "Discount Value"
msgstr "Hodnota zľavy"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:431
msgid ""
"For percentage: enter 10 for 10%. For fixed: enter amount in shop currency "
"(e.g., 5.00)."
msgstr ""
"Pre percentuálnu zľavu zadajte 10 pre 10 %. Pre pevnú zľavu zadajte sumu v "
"mene obchodu (napr. 5,00)."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:435
msgid "Apply Discount To"
msgstr "Uplatniť zľavu na"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:442
msgid "Which product(s) receive the discount."
msgstr "Na ktoré produkty sa zľava vzťahuje."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:447
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Zrušiť"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-settings.php:448
msgid "Save Rule"
msgstr "Uložiť pravidlo"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-frontend.php:134
msgid "Product not found."
msgstr "Produkt sa nenašiel."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-frontend.php:137
#: includes/class-m4w-wco-frontend.php:183
msgid "Add to Cart"
msgstr "Pridať do košíka"

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-frontend.php:159
msgid "Offer is not active for the current cart."
msgstr "Ponuka nie je aktívna pre aktuálny košík."

#: includes/class-m4w-wco-discounts.php:84
msgid "Conditional Offer Discount"
msgstr "Zľava podmienenej ponuky"
